Welcome to CargoBridge!

Revolutionizing Freight Forwarding through intelligent connections, AI Powered Marketplace & TMS for Logistics and Supply Chain Professionals. 

CargoBridge connects freight forwarders, carriers, shippers, consignees, customs brokers and other market players. In our unified seamless platform using Artificial Intelligence to increase productivity:

- Quoting / Inquiry processing. FTL, LTL, Sea, Doc's;
- Smart routing / Parking lots / Fuel station;
- CO2 emission calculation;
- eCMR / eFTI4EU;
- e-Signature
- Data analysis and prediction possible losses on data based dependencies.

Optimise and streamline your operations!
